@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam nodesep 90
skinparam ranksep 80

class MoveHandler {
  name = "move"
  --
  execute(args)
}

interface EditCommand {
  execute()
  undo()
  redo()
}

class CommandHistory {
  execute(command)
  undo()
  redo()
}

class MoveCommand {
  document : SvgDocument
  --
  execute()
  ..
  只转发
  ..
  shape.move(dx, dy)
}

class Shape {
  move(dx, dy)
  --
  修改自身几何属性
  ..
  容器再递归到子孙
}

MoveHandler --> MoveCommand : 构造
MoveHandler ..> CommandHistory : 委托执行
CommandHistory --> EditCommand : 持有
EditCommand <|.. MoveCommand
MoveCommand --> Shape : shape.move()
@enduml